Package: prometheus-opensearch-dashboards-exporter
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Prometheus exporter for OpenSearch Dashboards
 This package queries the OpenSearch Dashboards status API and exports status
 and process metrics over HTTP. Prometheus and compatible monitoring systems
 can collect the metrics from the exporter's /metrics endpoint.
